    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a ghost trapped in a haunted, maze-like house.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-paced Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ingenious puzzles while dodging enemies and traps in this challenging 2D puzzle game. Test your agility, precision, and quick thinking to conquer each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/62ddc43372d28b969af46583c75ff96a.poster.avif?t=1737512390\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/62ddc43372d28b969af46583c75ff96a.webm?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/62ddc43372d28b969af46583c75ff96a.mp4?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls and Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move only up, down, left, or right, sliding in straight lines until you hit a wall. Grab the key, dodge obstacles, and reach the door before time runs out! Easy to learn, but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/b4fc05272c07350ff933dd7a3d9569cb.poster.avif?t=1737512390\" width=800 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/b4fc05272c07350ff933dd7a3d9569cb.webm?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/b4fc05272c07350ff933dd7a3d9569cb.mp4?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventures and Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorers, get ready! Face challenging bosses and uncover secret rooms filled with mysteries and rewards. Adventure awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/482c258866156aac14b93a7ade896e11.poster.avif?t=1737512390\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/482c258866156aac14b93a7ade896e11.webm?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/482c258866156aac14b93a7ade896e11.mp4?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And More!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Handcrafted Challenges</strong><br>Every puzzle and level has been meticulously designed to strike the  balance between fun, challenge, and fairness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Infinite Gameplay</strong><br>Dive into secondary game modes with procedurally generated mini-levels\u00a0that keep the gameplay fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Speedrunner-Friendly</strong><br>Crafted with care to challenge even the fastest and most skilled players. Show us what you're capable of!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, are you ready to escape this haunted maze?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a ghost trapped in a haunted, maze-like house.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-paced Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve ingenious puzzles while dodging enemies and traps in this challenging 2D puzzle game. Test your agility, precision, and quick thinking to conquer each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/62ddc43372d28b969af46583c75ff96a.poster.avif?t=1737512390\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/62ddc43372d28b969af46583c75ff96a.webm?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/62ddc43372d28b969af46583c75ff96a.mp4?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls and Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move only up, down, left, or right, sliding in straight lines until you hit a wall. Grab the key, dodge obstacles, and reach the door before time runs out! Easy to learn, but hard to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/b4fc05272c07350ff933dd7a3d9569cb.poster.avif?t=1737512390\" width=800 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/b4fc05272c07350ff933dd7a3d9569cb.webm?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/b4fc05272c07350ff933dd7a3d9569cb.mp4?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventures and Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explorers, get ready! Face challenging bosses and uncover secret rooms filled with mysteries and rewards. Adventure awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/482c258866156aac14b93a7ade896e11.poster.avif?t=1737512390\" width=800 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/482c258866156aac14b93a7ade896e11.webm?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442830/extras/482c258866156aac14b93a7ade896e11.mp4?t=1737512390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And More!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Handcrafted Challenges</strong><br>Every puzzle and level has been meticulously designed to strike the  balance between fun, challenge, and fairness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Infinite Gameplay</strong><br>Dive into secondary game modes with procedurally generated mini-levels\u00a0that keep the gameplay fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Speedrunner-Friendly</strong><br>Crafted with care to challenge even the fastest and most skilled players. Show us what you're capable of!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, are you ready to escape this haunted maze?</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced 2D puzzle game where you play as a cheerful ghost, moving in straight lines until hitting a wall. Navigate through a haunted house, dodge traps, evil ghosts, and escape before becoming like them!",
